239
00:15:23,964 --> 00:15:28,886
We have an amiable relationship
with humans. So give us your bananas.

240
00:15:28,969 --> 00:15:31,388
I'll give it to you!
Anything if it's mine!

241
00:15:31,472 --> 00:15:34,475
I've been wanting to see aliens
for the longest time!

242
00:15:34,558 --> 00:15:36,018
Because I didn't have any friends,

243
00:15:36,101 --> 00:15:39,021
I thought at least aliens
would be my friends.

244
00:15:39,104 --> 00:15:43,734
I've been calling to the skies
for a UFO since grade school!

245
00:15:45,861 --> 00:15:47,571
<i>But you never came!</i>

246
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:51,533
<i>No matter how much I called for you,</i>
<i>you never showed up!</i>

247
00:15:51,617 --> 00:15:53,953
<i>Other humans bullied me</i>
<i>to pass their time.</i>

248
00:15:54,036 --> 00:15:56,497
<i>Aliens didn't give me the time of day.</i>

249
00:15:56,580 --> 00:16:00,250
<i>Nobody ever acknowledged my existence.</i>

250
00:16:00,334 --> 00:16:02,002
<i>But Miss Ayase….</i>

251
00:16:02,086 --> 00:16:05,089
<i>She actually stood up for me,</i>
<i>despite that!</i>

252
00:16:05,172 --> 00:16:08,384
So don't you lay a finger on her!

253
00:16:09,009 --> 00:16:12,554
I won't allow anyone to hurt her!

254
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:18,394
If it's for her sake,
I'll even become a monster!

255
00:16:18,477 --> 00:16:20,187
Keep at it, Occult-kun!

256
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:22,523
Show 'em what a man you are!

257
00:16:22,606 --> 00:16:23,399
Fie!

258
00:16:25,442 --> 00:16:26,568
Miss Ayase…

259
00:16:26,652 --> 00:16:27,903
It looks impossible after all.

260
00:16:27,987 --> 00:16:29,822
You gave up really fast there!

261
00:16:31,907 --> 00:16:35,828
We cannot become friends
with a violent person like you.

262
00:16:35,911 --> 00:16:40,708
Besides, we like woman persons
more than man persons.

263
00:16:40,791 --> 00:16:43,836
Now, once again,
I shall arouse your desire.

264
00:16:47,965 --> 00:16:49,133
<i>Take your chi out.</i>

265
00:16:49,216 --> 00:16:50,634
<i>I don't wanna.</i>

266
00:16:50,718 --> 00:16:55,014
{\an8}My friends make fun of me
every single day because of that.

267
00:16:55,097 --> 00:16:56,682
{\an8}What are you talking about?

268
00:16:56,765 --> 00:16:59,852
{\an8}If you have your chi out,
you won't get hurt or sick.

269
00:16:59,935 --> 00:17:01,812
{\an8}Bad things can't get near you.

270
00:17:02,813 --> 00:17:05,691
First, firm up your lower abs.

271
00:17:07,192 --> 00:17:10,904
Imagine having your chi shoot up
from the top of your head.

272
00:17:11,989 --> 00:17:13,115
{\an8}<i>She's doing it again!</i>

273
00:17:13,198 --> 00:17:14,950
{\an8}<i>Is she communicating</i>
<i>with aliens or something?</i>

274
00:17:17,202 --> 00:17:19,663
I hate it! I'm never doing it again!

275
00:17:19,747 --> 00:17:21,081
Momo! Hold on!

276
00:17:21,165 --> 00:17:24,251
I hate you, Grandma!
You fake spirit medium!

277
00:17:28,005 --> 00:17:31,175
<i>Why am I remembering the past right now?</i>

278
00:17:31,258 --> 00:17:36,013
<i>I'm sorry, Grandma.</i>
<i>I just felt embarrassed back then.</i>

279
00:17:37,723 --> 00:17:40,392
<i>Firm up your lower abs.</i>

280
00:17:42,061 --> 00:17:44,521
<i>Chi shoot up from the top of your head.</i>

281
00:17:49,401 --> 00:17:50,152
No way!

282
00:17:50,736 --> 00:17:51,570
What?

283
00:17:51,653 --> 00:17:53,864
Miss Ayase, you can use psychic powers?

284
00:17:53,947 --> 00:17:56,492
Well, I'm surprised by that myself!

285
00:17:56,575 --> 00:17:59,995
Unbelievable!
My psychokinesis is being pushed back!

286
00:18:00,079 --> 00:18:01,455
Why?

287
00:18:01,538 --> 00:18:03,791
Did I stimulate her brain waves too much

288
00:18:03,874 --> 00:18:07,002
and cause
the woman person's chakra to open up?

289
00:18:07,086 --> 00:18:08,212
She was for real.

290
00:18:08,295 --> 00:18:11,298
Grandma was a real spirit medium!

291
00:18:11,381 --> 00:18:13,050
Thank you, Grandma!

292
00:18:13,133 --> 00:18:15,928
With this, I can take those scumbags…

293
00:18:17,179 --> 00:18:18,430
and send them flying!

294
00:18:34,488 --> 00:18:36,532
What is this? That was a UFO?

295
00:18:37,032 --> 00:18:38,367
Occult-kun, are you okay?

296
00:18:38,450 --> 00:18:40,160
Let's get outta here!

297
00:18:44,706 --> 00:18:49,169
Ow! What are you doing, idiot!
Regain your sanity already!

298
00:18:49,253 --> 00:18:51,463
Damn you!

299
00:18:57,094 --> 00:18:58,554
Turbo Granny?

300
00:18:58,637 --> 00:19:01,181
Who the hell are you?

301
00:19:04,643 --> 00:19:05,978
His curse hasn't lifted!

302
00:19:06,061 --> 00:19:07,980
Granny is out of his body, though!

303
00:19:08,063 --> 00:19:11,775
I have possession of that kid's weenie.

304
00:19:11,859 --> 00:19:16,196
As long as I have his weenie,
that kid's curse won't be lifted.

305
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:18,907
If you want it back, come to the tunnel.

306
00:19:18,991 --> 00:19:21,160
This place is too far for me.

307
00:19:21,243 --> 00:19:26,248
I'll take you on as much as you want
if it's in the tunnel, gaudy hag.

308
00:19:26,331 --> 00:19:28,834
Who you calling a gaudy hag,
you old bag of crap!

309
00:19:28,917 --> 00:19:30,294
Give him back his thingy!

310
00:19:33,255 --> 00:19:36,341
Crap! If we don't escape, we're gonna die!

311
00:19:36,425 --> 00:19:39,178
Get a grip, you idiot! We're gonna escape!

312
00:19:59,656 --> 00:20:01,533
This is the worst.

313
00:20:02,117 --> 00:20:05,996
{\an8}I'll believe in aliens.
Like, I was kidnapped and all.

314
00:20:06,079 --> 00:20:09,708
{\an8}I'll believe in ghosts, too.
I got cursed after all.

315
00:20:09,791 --> 00:20:12,169
{\an8}So, what should we do from here?

316
00:20:12,252 --> 00:20:13,670
{\an8}What should we do?

317
00:20:13,754 --> 00:20:17,883
You lose control of yourself if I don't
hold the curse back with psychic powers.

318
00:20:17,966 --> 00:20:18,800
I'm sorry.

319
00:20:18,884 --> 00:20:22,638
I lost my uniform, my wallet,
my smartphone. Everything.

320
00:20:23,222 --> 00:20:26,141
{\an8}How can I lift this curse?

321
00:20:26,225 --> 00:20:28,977
{\an8}You have to beat the crap out of
Turbo Granny.

322
00:20:29,061 --> 00:20:30,520
{\an8}She's the cause of the curse.

323
00:20:30,604 --> 00:20:34,691
{\an8}I see. Then I'll head on over there.

324
00:20:34,775 --> 00:20:36,235
{\an8}Huh? Right now?

325
00:20:37,277 --> 00:20:39,947
{\an8}Miss Ayase, please wear
my clothes back home.

326
00:20:40,030 --> 00:20:42,824
{\an8}Hold on! You'll lose control without me!

327
00:20:46,870 --> 00:20:51,583
All of this happened
because of what I did.

328
00:20:51,667 --> 00:20:53,919
I can't get you involved
in it anymore, Miss Ayase.

329
00:20:54,002 --> 00:20:56,421
I'll use willpower
to make it to the tunnel,

330
00:20:56,505 --> 00:20:58,590
and then make it work somehow.

331
00:20:59,466 --> 00:21:01,969
Why can't you ask me to come with you?

332
00:21:02,052 --> 00:21:04,763
After that experience earlier,
I can't leave you alone!

333
00:21:04,846 --> 00:21:07,849
You would've died earlier
if I wasn't around!

334
00:21:09,434 --> 00:21:12,980
Is it okay for you
to help someone like me?

335
00:21:13,063 --> 00:21:15,315
Stuff like that is such a hassle.

336
00:21:23,323 --> 00:21:25,367
Come on, put some clothes on.

337
00:21:27,536 --> 00:21:28,495
Let's go!

338
00:21:29,037 --> 00:21:30,289
I'm sorry.

339
00:21:30,372 --> 00:21:32,749
I am an awkward fellow, after all.

340
00:21:34,042 --> 00:21:36,420
Miss Ayase, please put some clothes on.

341
00:21:36,503 --> 00:21:38,880
If you don't, I can't bring myself
to speak properly.

342
00:21:40,215 --> 00:21:43,135
<i>No way. Why is my heart racing?</i>

343
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:45,095
<i>This can't be.</i>

344
00:21:45,178 --> 00:21:49,099
<i>I was just surprised because he happened</i>
<i>to recite one of Ken Takakura's lines.</i>

345
00:21:49,641 --> 00:21:52,060
<i>I need to calm down for now.</i>

346
00:21:54,062 --> 00:21:56,523
By the way, what's your name?

347
00:21:56,606 --> 00:21:58,942
I'm terrible at remembering names.

348
00:21:59,026 --> 00:22:00,902
Oh? Um…

349
00:22:00,986 --> 00:22:02,362
I'm Ken Takakura.

350
00:23:43,505 --> 00:23:44,965
<i>Aliens really did exist!</i>

351
00:23:45,048 --> 00:23:46,675
<i>Ghosts exist, too!</i>

352
00:23:46,758 --> 00:23:49,136
<i>The existence of aliens and ghosts</i>
<i>being proven means that</i>

353
00:23:49,219 --> 00:23:50,804
<i>there's a possibility of supernatural</i>
<i>phenomena, UMA,</i>

354
00:23:50,887 --> 00:23:52,597
<i>and all other things that were said to be</i>
<i>absurd can be proven as well.</i>

355
00:23:52,681 --> 00:23:53,557
<i>Oh, fine, I get it! Ready.</i>

356
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:56,143
<i>Next episode,</i>
<i>"That's a Space Alien, Ain't It?!"</i>

357
00:23:56,226 --> 00:23:57,936
<i>Hey, be in sync with me!</i>
